    "note": "A minimal synthetic DataProcessor (ChartFormTest) with one Form carrying a single pl:Planner-typed attribute \"Планировщик\" and a PlannerField bound to it, built from the shape the five native planner attributes of Документооборот КОРП 3.0.21.3 carry. Each variant changes one axis of the control and is round-tripped through ibcmd 8.3.27.2214 itself; the raw entry is the whole slot-14 field of the attribute record as the round-tripped .cf stores it."
  },
  "claims": [
    "The design record is unwrapped as {0,1,\"Planner\",{\"#\",<type uuid>,{8,<item count>,…}}}.",
    "Member 1 declares how many <pl:item> blocks follow, and the 31 tail members sit behind them; seeds items-two and items-zero move the count and the record length together.",
    "The stored colour pair is text-then-back where the platform writes back-then-text, in the planner block and in each item.",
    "A <pl:timeScale> declares its own level count in member 2 and the reader walks it."
  ],
  "non_claims": [
    "The record members no observation varies -- the leading 8, the 0 behind the item run, the 1 and 0 on either side of <pl:period>, the item's leading 3, its {\"U\"} value, its second font-shaped member and its three padding zeroes -- are required to read as observed rather than interpreted.",
    "<pl:itemsBehaviorWhenSpaceInsufficient> names only the ordinal 0 (CollapseItems): it is the only spelling the XDTO enumeration accepted of the twelve tried, so any other ordinal is refused.",
    "The <dayFormatRule> ordinal 0 is unnamed: no spelling the XDTO enumeration accepts maps to it."
  ],
